headers {
  Authorization: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # ImageNetOG Redux — read API collection
  
  Every request inherits the `Authorization: {{authToken}}` header defined here.
  The API Gateway Cognito authorizer accepts the raw Cognito JWT (no `Bearer`
  prefix). Obtain a token via the `Auth/Get Token` request after logging in
  through the Cognito hosted UI — see the project README section
  "API spec & Bruno collection" for the full walkthrough.
  
  Select the `dev` environment and populate its variables before running
  requests. The `Auth/Get Token` request overrides this header (the token
  exchange itself is unauthenticated), and the "unauthenticated" negative-path
  request clears it to demonstrate the 401 contract.
}
